<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Q6 - Responsive CSS Cheat Sheet</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial; background: #f4f6f8; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
.grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 15px;
}
.box {
  background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.box:hover { transform: scale(1.05); background: #eaf2ff; }
h3 { color: #333; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Responsive CSS Cheat Sheet</h1>
<div class="grid">
  <div class="box"><h3>Filters</h3><p>Use blur(), grayscale(), sepia(), etc.</p></div>
  <div class="box"><h3>Media Queries</h3><p>@media (max-width: 600px)</p></div>
  <div class="box"><h3>Responsive Design</h3><p>Flexible layouts using flexbox or grid.</p></div>
  <div class="box"><h3>Typography</h3><p>Use relative units like em, rem, and vw.</p></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
